I walk towards a court.
There are three people there.
They are practicing on the court.
I go near them.
"Hello!" I say to them.
A man smiles and says, "Hello!"
"My name is Maya," I say.
"I am Sanjay."
"This is Amit, and this is Neha," the man says.
Amit and Neha smile and greet me.
I ask them, "Can I play with you?"
"I know how to play badminton well," I tell them.
"And I like to play doubles a lot."
Amit smiles and says, "Yes, definitely!"
"There are only three of us," Neha says.
"We need one more player."
I am very happy.
I hold my rented racket in my hand.
I step onto the court.
We start to play doubles.
